strategy.description:
`nvidia.com/gpu.sharing-strategy`: "none", "time-slicing" or "mps";
"mig" when `nvidia.com/mig.strategy` is set. Empty when GPU Feature
Discovery reports none.

id.description:
Organization identifier: the Tenant's id. Required, and an RFC 1123 DNS
label, because the backend qualifies owner groups as <id>/<group>;
immutable once set.
